    <string name="chat_greeting_format">Hi %1$s! 👋 I\'m your CloudDesk support assistant. Tell me what you\'re running into and I\'ll help, or point you to the right team.</string>
    <string name="chat_input_hint">Type a message…</string>
    <string name="chat_online_status">● Online</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_default">Got it, thanks for the details. A technician will follow up shortly. In the meantime, feel free to submit a ticket from the dashboard so we can track this properly.</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_greeting">Hey there! What can I help you with today?</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_login">For login issues, try the \'Forgot Password\' link on the sign-in screen first. If that doesn\'t work, I can raise a ticket for our Auth team — want me to do that?</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_thanks">You\'re welcome! Let me know if anything else comes up.</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_ticket_status">You can check the status of any ticket from your dashboard — tap on it to see the latest updates and comments. Do you have a ticket number handy?</string>
    <string name="chat_reply_urgent">That sounds urgent — I\'d recommend submitting a ticket right away so it gets flagged as high priority automatically. I\'m also looping in a technician now.</string>
