    <string name="faq_1_body">On the sign-in screen tap \"Forgot password?\", enter your email, answer your security question and choose a new password. If your account has no security question, ask an administrator to reset it.</string>
    <string name="faq_1_title">I forgot my password</string>
    <string name="faq_2_body">Tap the + button on your dashboard, enter a title and description, pick a category and priority (the app suggests one) and attach a file if it helps. Then tap submit.</string>
    <string name="faq_2_title">How do I submit a ticket?</string>
    <string name="faq_3_body">Targets depend on priority: Critical 4 hours, High 24 hours, Medium 72 hours, Low 120 hours. Overdue tickets are flagged for the support team.</string>
    <string name="faq_3_title">How long until my ticket is handled?</string>
    <string name="faq_4_body">Restart your device, forget and re-join the Wi-Fi network, and update the VPN app. If it still drops, submit a ticket in the Network category.</string>
    <string name="faq_4_title">My Wi-Fi or VPN keeps disconnecting</string>
    <string name="faq_5_body">Restart it, close apps you are not using, free up storage space and install pending updates. If it is still slow, submit a Hardware or Software ticket.</string>
    <string name="faq_5_title">My computer is slow</string>
    <string name="faq_6_body">Open the ticket from your dashboard. The history shows every status change and assignment. Once the ticket is Resolved, the person who opened it can give a 1 to 5 star rating.</string>
    <string name="faq_6_title">How do I rate a ticket or see its history?</string>
